  $120$&0.66&0.81&1.57&0.39&0.48&0.99&0.11&0.15&0.57 \\
  $125$&0.58&0.70&1.37&0.34&0.42&0.88&0.09&0.13&0.51 \\
  $130$&0.51&0.62&1.21&0.30&0.37&0.79&0.08&0.12&0.45 \\ \hline
